WEBVTT

00:00:00.579 --> 00:00:01.656
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> <b>Are</b> you hungry?

00:00:03.596 --> 00:00:05.220
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> <b>Is</b> there a bank near here?

00:00:07.194 --> 00:00:08.196
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> <b>Can</b> I sit here?

00:00:10.256 --> 00:00:11.560
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> What <b>was</b> that noise?

00:00:13.544 --> 00:00:14.729
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Where <b>were</b> you born?